                                "sense_id": "1884abfe-7535-3d94-8353-9eb0bb36878a",
                                "text": "Well, for one thing a Woodie is the last remnant of the true coach-builders' art, dating from a time when wood […]. But a Woodie is also an icon, emblematic of beaches and surfing and Pacific Coast Highway […]"
